----- stdout -----
OpenBMP — Open Body Motion Platform CLI

Usage: openbmp [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run                Run a scenario through the kernel and write telemetry
  diff               Compare two telemetry archives byte-for-byte
  check              Lint a scenario without running it
  conform            Run one or more scenarios as a fork-runnable conformance smoke suite
  verify-order       Verify integrator observed order and Richardson/GCI behavior
  reconstruct        Run offline reconstruction and filter-consistency evidence commands
  trajopt            Run offline trajectory optimization and I-load synthesis commands
  compare-telemetry  Compare a scenario run against external local telemetry CSV / JSON
  footprint-mc       Run offline landing-footprint Monte Carlo post-processing
  mc                 Monte Carlo utility commands
  check-provenance   Walk a data/scenario tree and verify provenance records
  dict               Export command/telemetry dictionaries
  package            Validate mission package manifests
  run-package        Run a mission package test case through the native SIL path
  sil                Native SIL testbench operations
  migrate            Rewrite scenario documents to newer schema shapes
  help               Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -t, --trace...  Increase tracing verbosity. May be passed multiple times (`-t`, `-tt`, `-ttt` ⇒
                  INFO / DEBUG / TRACE)
  -h, --help      Print help
  -V, --version   Print version

